 and Disco Elysium (<i>Lenval Brown</i>). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 2-4 hours of gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several minigames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/97d9985469b1a49ce77eec792281d702.poster.avif?t=1786114726\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/97d9985469b1a49ce77eec792281d702.webm?t=1786114726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/97d9985469b1a49ce77eec792281d702.mp4?t=1786114726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by our personal experiences with local tea shops across the United Kingdom, as well as countless wholesome interactions with kind and wise role models in our lives, this heartfelt visual novel tells a side less told, of a life well lived, and a youth come and gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras/3a5d940bb9c8be776e1b02ff0a01c95c.avif?t=1786114726\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/extras_big/3a5d940bb9c8be776e1b02ff0a01c95c.avif?t=1786114726 width=800 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sips and Sonnets is brought to you by Blue Tango Street, the same team that gave you the brief and humble experience of Backspace Backspace Backspace. This visual novel was made possible thanks to collaborating with a group of talented artists!</p>",
